<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">Jaira Burns</ttm:name></ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"><ttm:name type="full">Soyeon</ttm:name></ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v3"><ttm:name type="full">Madison Beer</ttm:name></ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v4"><ttm:name type="full">Miyeon</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">谁人降临你心知肚明</text><text for="L2">盛宴再度席卷而来</text><text for="L3">渴望品尝这剂致命诱惑吧</text><text for="L4">就在此刻</text><text for="L5">正是 K/DA 哈！</text><text for="L6">身负利刃的女武神降临</text><text for="L7">高声呼喊我的名字</text><text for="L8">让它铭刻心底难以忘怀</text><text for="L9">震耳欲聋 响彻云霄</text><text for="L10">我能直登绝顶之巅</text><text for="L11">锋芒毕露绝不停歇</text><text for="L12">我就是这般无懈可击</text><text for="L13">致命恶女 狂野放肆</text><text for="L14">当我开启这般诱惑腔调 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(就像这样)</span></text><text for="L15">噢 你定会方寸大乱不知所措</text><text for="L16">拥有颠倒众生的无瑕面容</text><text for="L17">血脉里却奔涌着野性</text><text for="L18">倾听那致命诱惑中的</text><text for="L19">阵阵低吼 撩动心弦</text><text for="L20">此刻就将目光牢牢落在我身上</text><text for="L21">无论眼前呈现何景 你都会深深沦陷</text><text for="L22">遥不可及的全新境界</text><text for="L23">我深知你渴望与我一较高下</text><text for="L24">如今全场尽在掌心之中</text><text for="L25">那你可承受得住我们全部狂澜</text><text for="L26">我们无坚不摧</text><text for="L27">毫不畏惧将你彻底折服</text><text for="L28">此刻可感受到血脉贲张的狂涌？</text><text for="L29">谁也休想让我们屈服</text><text for="L30">坠落 沉沦 败退 俯首 认输</text><text for="L31">尽可妄图撼动 但王冠终将为我们加冕</text><text for="L32">你大可再来战上一轮</text><text for="L33">轮番交锋 战火重燃 回合再起</text><text for="L34">祝你好运 可惜你休想动摇我们分毫</text><text for="L35">我们全力以赴</text><text for="L36">直到囊括一切心之所向</text><text for="L37">势不可挡</text><text for="L38">全情沉浸全心投入</text><text for="L39">我们就是闪耀巨星</text><text for="L40">唯有凯旋 唯有连胜</text><text for="L41">没有人能将我们击落</text><text for="L42">击坠 击溃 击沉</text><text for="L43">嘿！</text><text for="L44">准备好迎接这一击了吗？ <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(出发！)</span></text><text for="L45">看好了 无论何时我的身影皆如幻法莫测</text><text for="L46">只消一击便将全场瞬息掌控</text><text for="L47">绝不露怯 气势如虹 哈！</text><text for="L48">枪火轰鸣 你又懂得什么</text><text for="L49">纵然极力渴求 亦难以承受</text><text for="L50">你的渴望早已写满脸庞</text><text for="L51">我是致命麻烦 而你偏偏甘愿沉沦</text><text for="L52">我冷冽如霜</text><text for="L53">当我踏出曼妙步履</text><text for="L54">你必将被惊艳震撼得哑口无言</text><text for="L55">我是全场最有真本事的王者 哈！</text><text for="L56">说我手执利刃 浑身烈焰燃烧</text><text for="L57">你即将听闻我的威名</text><text for="L58">在你脑海深处久久回响 宛若惊雷 噢</text><text for="L59">现在的你 只管将视线紧随于我</text><text for="L60">无论眼见何等璀璨 你皆会为之倾倒</text><text for="L61">我们坚不可摧</text><text for="L62">从不畏惧将你的光芒尽数掩盖</text><text for="L63">此刻是否已感到心潮翻涌？</text><text for="L64">凡尘俗世无人能令我们俯首</text><text for="L65">败亡 沉沦 坠落 屈服 臣服</text><text for="L66">任凭旁人百般试探 王冠终将由我们戴上</text><text for="L67">尽管重整旗鼓再来鏖战一场</text><text for="L68">循环往复 轮番试探 胜负已定</text><text for="L69">祝你好运 但你休想撼动我们的地位</text><text for="L70">全力开火</text><text for="L71">不达顶峰誓不罢休</text><text for="L72">倾力一战</text><text for="L73">浑然忘我倾注全力</text><text for="L74">我们就是流行巨星</text><text for="L75">唯胜不败 所向披靡</text><text for="L76">谁也别妄想让我们坠下神坛</text><text for="L77">沦陷 瓦解 沉没</text><text for="L78">噢 我绝不会驻足停息</text><text for="L79">噢 噢 我们的锋芒永不停歇</text><text for="L80">噢 噢 我们是至高闪耀的流行巨星 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(群星闪耀)</span></text><text for="L81">璀璨星辰 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(万丈光芒)</span></text><text for="L82">没有谁能令我们跌落云端 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(谁也休想让我们)</span></text><text for="L83">俯首 跌落 溃退 沉寂 认败</text><text for="L84">纵使群雄觊觎 这顶王冠亦由我们稳稳戴上</text><text for="L85">你尽可卷土重来再战一番</text><text for="L86">鏖战不休 回合重来 依然落败</text><text for="L87">愿你走运 但你绝不可能将我们击溃</text><text for="L88">全力冲刺</text><text for="L89">直至将至高荣耀尽收囊中</text><text for="L90">燃爆全场</text><text for="L91">极尽狂热身心交融</text><text for="L92">我们就是天生传奇巨星</text><text for="L93">如今只余凯旋</text><text for="L94">绝无任何人能让我们走下王座</text><text for="L95">覆灭 俯首 终结</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="POP/STARS (feat. Jaira Burns &amp; League of Legends Music)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="K/DA, Madison Beer &amp; i-dle"/><amll:meta key="album" value="POP/STARS (feat. Jaira Burns &amp; League of Legends Music) - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1831861474"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:05.982" end="3:07.131"><p begin="0:05.982" end="0:07.192" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.982" end="0:06.132">You</span> <span begin="0:06.132" end="0:06.382">know</span> <span begin="0:06.382" end="0:06.602">who</span> <span begin="0:06.602" end="0:06.802">it</span> <span begin="0:06.802" end="0:07.192">is</span></p><p begin="0:07.412" end="0:08.532" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.412" end="0:07.572">Co</span><span begin="0:07.572" end="0:07.792">ming</span> <span begin="0:07.792" end="0:08.022">'round</span> <span begin="0:08.022" end="0:08.092">a</span><span begin="0:08.092" end="0:08.532">gain</span></p><p begin="0:08.669" end="0:09.929" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.669" end="0:08.799">You</span> <span begin="0:08.799" end="0:09.069">want</span> <span begin="0:09.069" end="0:09.139">a</span> <span begin="0:09.139" end="0:09.429">dose</span> <span begin="0:09.429" end="0:09.529">of</span> <span begin="0:09.529" end="0:09.929">this</span></p><p begin="0:09.928" end="0:10.428" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.928" end="0:10.248">Right</span> <span begin="0:10.248" end="0:10.428">now</span></p><p begin="0:10.440" end="0:11.550" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.440" end="0:10.580">It’s</span> <span begin="0:10.580" end="0:10.810">K/</span><span begin="0:10.810" end="0:11.010">D</span><span begin="0:11.010" end="0:11.220">A</span> <span begin="0:11.340" end="0:11.550">uh!</span></p><p begin="0:12.026" end="0:13.331" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:12.026" end="0:12.216">I'm</span> <span begin="0:12.216" end="0:12.296">a</span> <span begin="0:12.296" end="0:12.576">go</span><span begin="0:12.576" end="0:12.746">ddess</span> <span begin="0:12.746" end="0:12.936">with</span> <span begin="0:12.936" end="0:13.006">a</span> <span begin="0:13.006" end="0:13.331">blade</span></p><p begin="0:13.335" end="0:14.544" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:13.335" end="0:14.095">소리쳐 봐</span> <span begin="0:14.095" end="0:14.343">내</span> <span begin="0:14.343" end="0:14.544">이름</span></p><p begin="0:14.757" end="0:15.560" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:14.757" end="0:15.063">잊지</span> <span begin="0:15.063" end="0:15.560">못하게</span></p><p begin="0:15.700" end="0:17.310" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:15.700" end="0:16.230">Loud,</span> <span begin="0:16.230" end="0:16.630">loud,</span> <span begin="0:16.630" end="0:16.980">loud,</span> <span begin="0:16.980" end="0:17.310">loud</span></p><p begin="0:17.680" end="0:18.883" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:17.680" end="0:17.790">I</span> <span begin="0:17.790" end="0:17.990">could</span> <span begin="0:17.990" end="0:18.220">take</span> <span begin="0:18.220" end="0:18.360">it</span> <span begin="0:18.360" end="0:18.540">to</span> <span begin="0:18.540" end="0:18.660">the</span> <span begin="0:18.660" end="0:18.883">top</span></p><p begin="0:19.040" end="0:20.217" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:19.040" end="0:19.380">절대</span> <span begin="0:19.380" end="0:19.864">멈추지</span> <span begin="0:19.864" end="0:20.217">못해</span></p><p begin="0:20.416" end="0:21.351" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:20.416" end="0:20.704">내가</span> <span begin="0:20.704" end="0:21.351">끝내 주는</span></p><p begin="0:21.369" end="0:22.999" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:21.369" end="0:21.879">Bad</span> <span begin="0:21.879" end="0:22.279">gal,</span> <span begin="0:22.279" end="0:22.609">gal,</span> <span begin="0:22.609" end="0:22.999">gal</span></p><p begin="0:23.249" end="0:26.122" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="0:23.249" end="0:23.509">And</span> <span begin="0:23.509" end="0:23.809">when</span> <span begin="0:23.809" end="0:23.929">I</span> <span begin="0:23.929" end="0:24.209">start</span> <span begin="0:24.209" end="0:24.289">to</span> <span begin="0:24.289" end="0:24.689">talk</span> <span begin="0:24.689" end="0:25.059">like</span> <span begin="0:25.059" end="0:25.609">that</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="0:25.070" end="0:26.122"><span begin="0:25.070" end="0:25.690">(Like</span> <span begin="0:25.690" end="0:26.122">that)</span></span></p><p begin="0:26.181" end="0:28.581" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="0:26.181" end="0:26.311">Oh,</span> <span begin="0:26.311" end="0:26.611">you</span> <span begin="0:26.611" end="0:26.871">won’t</span> <span begin="0:26.871" end="0:27.161">know</span> <span begin="0:27.161" end="0:27.391">how</span> <span begin="0:27.391" end="0:27.571">to</span> <span begin="0:27.571" end="0:27.951">re</span><span begin="0:27.951" end="0:28.581">act</span></p><p begin="0:28.904" end="0:30.344" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="0:28.904" end="0:29.164">I’m</span> <span begin="0:29.164" end="0:29.254">a</span> <span begin="0:29.254" end="0:29.464">pic</span><span begin="0:29.464" end="0:29.604">ture</span> <span begin="0:29.604" end="0:29.804">per</span><span begi